#: selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\developer.py
msgid "<b>WARNING: sunnypilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, sunnypilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of sunnypilot's longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to sunnypilot longitudinal control. Enabling Experimental mode is recommended when enabling sunnypilot longitudinal control alpha. Changing this setting will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "<b>警告：此車型的 sunnypilot 縱向控制為 Alpha 版，可能停用自動緊急制動 (AEB)。</b><br><br>此車型預設使用原廠 ACC 而非 sunnypilot 縱向控制。啟用此項可切換至 sunnypilot 縱向控制。啟用縱向控制 Alpha 時建議同時啟用實驗模式。若車輛通電，變更此設定將重啟 sunnypilot。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\alpha_longitudinal_toggles.py
msgid "<b>WARNING: zoompilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, zoompilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of zoompilot's longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to zoompilot longitudinal control. Changing this setting will restart zoompilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "<b>警告：zoompilot 縱向控制在當前車型上為 Alpha 版，可能導致自動緊急制動（AEB）失效。</b><br><br>當前車型預設使用車輛自帶 ACC 而非 zoompilot 縱向控制。開啟此項以切換到 zoompilot 縱向控制。車輛上電狀態下更改此設定將重啟 zoompilot。"

