#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\models.py
msgid "Adds a gentle nudge toward lane center on top of the model's own steering, stronger when lane lines are clear. Yields around obstacles. The blue line and the gauge under the torque bar show the strength and direction of correction. The developer UI shows the exact adjustment in cm. Not available with the Default model."
msgstr "在模型自身轉向的基礎上輕微向車道中心修正，車道線清晰時修正更強。遇到障礙物會讓行。藍線和扭矩條下方的儀表顯示修正的強度和方向。開發者介面以釐米顯示精確調整量。預設模型下不可用。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\cruise.py
msgid "Adds a small push on top of sunnypilot's own acceleration, stronger in Aggressive and gentler in Relaxed. Eases off in curves and when sunnypilot slows or stops. Never goes past your set speed, and lead-car following still comes first."
msgstr "在 sunnypilot 自身加速度之上疊加小幅助推，激進個性下更強、放鬆個性下更柔和。過彎以及減速、停車時會自動收力。永遠不會超過你的設定車速，跟車避撞仍然優先。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\mici\layouts\cruise.py
msgid ""
"Adds an offset to the speed limit.\n"
"Fixed adds a set amount of speed. % adds a percentage of the limit."
msgstr ""
"對限速增加一個偏移量。\n"
"固定：增加設定的速度值；%：按限速的百分比增加。"

