#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\mici\layouts\steering.py
msgid ""
"Lateral acceleration factor: how much the car turns per unit of torque.\n"
"Higher values steer with less torque."
msgstr ""
"橫向加速度係數：每單位扭矩讓車輛轉多少。\n"
"數值越大，所需轉向扭矩越小。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Lead Acceleration Response"
msgstr "前車加速響應"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\cruise_sub_layouts\longitudinal_mpc_tuning.py
msgid "Lead Danger Factor"
msgstr "前車危險係數"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\visuals.py
msgid "Lead Departure Alert (Beta)"
msgstr "引匯出發警報（測試版）"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\mici\layouts\steering.py
msgid ""
"Learns how your car steers as you drive and tunes to match.\n"
"It learns each speed range separately."
msgstr ""
"駕駛過程中學習你車輛的轉向特性並自動調校。\n"
"每個速度區間分別學習。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Lengthen the follow time, widen the stopped gap and lower the acceleration and lateral limits in bad weather. The weather is detected from the car's position; these offsets are what gets applied."
msgstr "惡劣天氣下延長跟車時距、加大停車間距並降低加速度與橫向加速度上限。天氣根據車輛位置自動偵測；此處設定的是實際疊加的補償量。"

#: selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\toggles.py
msgid "Lenient"
msgstr "寬鬆"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\steering_sub_layouts\torque_settings.py
msgid "Less Restrict Settings for Self-Tune (Beta)"
msgstr "自調整的限制設定較少（測試版）"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\steering_sub_layouts\torque_settings.py
msgid "Less strict settings when using Self-Tune. This allows torqued to be more forgiving when learning values."
msgstr "自學習時使用較寬鬆設定，使 torqued 在學習引數時更寬容。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\navigation.py
msgid "Let the Carrot app's turn instruction act as a turn signal. This reaches the car's real turn signal, so it is off by default."
msgstr "允許 Carrot 應用程式的轉向指令充當方向燈。此功能會作用到車輛真實方向燈，因此預設關閉。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the phone app drive the longitudinal plan: its target speed becomes a plan source, and its follow time, comfort braking and stop point reach the MPC. Off keeps stock sunnypilot behaviour. Needs a connected phone - without a fresh packet the source stays inactive."
msgstr "讓手機 App 驅動縱向規劃：其目標速度成為一個規劃源，其跟車時距、舒適制動與停車點進入 MPC。關閉時保持 sunnypilot 原廠行為。需要手機保持連線——沒有新鮮資料時該源自動失效。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the phone app guided-lane arrows block lane changes toward non-guided lanes. Only ever adds blocking."
msgstr "允許手機 App 的車道引導箭頭封鎖往非引導車道的變道，只會增加封鎖。"

#: selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\toggles.py
msgid "Lets you choose how sunnypilot starts, catches up, and settles at the cruise speed. Emergency braking and stopping are unchanged."
msgstr "讓您選擇 sunnypilot 如何起步、跟上並穩定在巡航速度。緊急煞車與停車行為不變。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\mici\layouts\alpha_longitudinal.py
msgid ""
"Lets zoompilot control the gas and brakes instead of stock cruise.\n"
"This may turn off Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB)."
msgstr ""
"由 zoompilot 而非原廠巡航控制油門和剎車。\n"
"這可能會關閉自動緊急制動（AEB）。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\mici\layouts\steering.py
msgid ""
"Lets zoompilot steer while cruise control is off.\n"
"When off, steering and cruise engage and disengage together."
msgstr ""
"允許在巡航關閉時由 zoompilot 轉向。\n"
"關閉時轉向與巡航同時掛入、同時退出。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\steering.py
msgid "Lets zoompilot steer while cruise control is off. When off, steering and cruise engage and disengage together."
msgstr "允許 zoompilot 在巡航關閉時獨立轉向。關閉後，轉向與巡航同時啟停。"

