msgid ""
"Live learns how long your car takes to respond to steering, as stock openpilot does.\n"
"A number is a fixed software delay instead. Default is live."
msgstr ""
"像原版 openpilot 一樣，Live 實時學習車輛轉向響應時間。\n"
"填數字則改為固定軟體延遲。預設 Live。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\models.py
msgid "Live learns your car's steering response time as you drive, the stock openpilot experience. A number is a fixed software delay instead. Default is Live."
msgstr "Live 會在行駛中實時學習你車的轉向響應時間，即原版 openpilot 體驗。填數字則改為固定軟體延遲。預設 Live。"

