msgid "Run the YOLOv8 traffic-light detector on the road camera and draw a box around each detected signal housing on the driving view, with the observed signal (red light, green light, turn arrows) written under the box.<br>Runs at most 2 Hz on the little cores and is display only: it never feeds the planner and never lets openpilot act on a traffic light on your behalf. Always check the light yourself."
