msgid "Set how sensitive the driver distraction detection should be. Strict: Very sensitive, warns on minor distractions. Moderate: Balanced between sensitivity and false positives. Lenient: Only alerts on clear distractions. "
msgstr "設定駕駛員分心偵測的靈敏度。嚴格：非常靈敏，輕微分心也會警告。中等：在靈敏度與誤報之間平衡。寬鬆：僅在明顯分心時提醒。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\mici\layouts\steering.py
msgid ""
"Setting or resuming a cruise speed also turns steering on.\n"
"Steering then stays on until you switch it off or turn off the car."
msgstr ""
"設定或恢復巡航車速時也會開啟轉向。\n"
"轉向將保持開啟，直到你手動關閉或熄火。"

#: selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\steering_sub_layouts\mads_settings.py
msgid "Setting or resuming a cruise speed also turns steering on. Steering then stays on until you switch it off or turn off the car."
msgstr "設定或恢復巡航車速時也會開啟轉向，轉向將保持開啟，直到你手動關閉或熄火。"

