msgid ""
"Shows a QR code to sponsor sunnypilot, the project behind sunnylink.\n"
"Sponsors get early access to new sunnylink features."
msgstr ""
"顯示二維碼以贊助 sunnylink（sunnypilot 背後的專案）。\n"
"贊助者可搶先體驗 sunnylink 新功能。"

